                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Prospective observational cohort study conducted between March 2023 and May 2025 to investigate the incidence clinical impact of respiratory viruses in three Dutch nursing home organisations encompassing 15 nursing home locations in the Amsterdam region. Due to the general objection (opt-out) procedure, which does not include the option for explicit consent for reuse, study data cannot be made available."
